# Choose how your name appears in the chapter credits.
#
# The credits on each chapter's welcome page come from git history. If your
# commits use a name or email you'd rather not show, add a line mapping it to
# the name you want:
#
#   Preferred Name <preferred@example.com> Old Name <old@example.com>
#
# Using your GitHub noreply email (12345+username@users.noreply.github.com)
# lets the book show your GitHub avatar next to your name.
